{"type":"message","id":"21877073","parentId":"3e2a438a","timestamp":"2026-04-20T21:29:17.312Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"用户触发了心跳检查，我需要读取 HEARTBEAT.md 并按要求执行扫描任务，当前时间是 5:28 AM 接近 08:00 早盘扫描时间，开始执行市场新闻扫描、恐惧贪婪指数获取和财报日历检查。\n\n\n我来读取 HEARTBEAT.md 并执行心跳任务。\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9160b163122546be9f5d7c5f","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"gitcode","model":"Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776720538643}}
{"type":"message","id":"e3cfbc0c","parentId":"21877073","timestamp":"2026-04-20T21:29:17.328Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9160b163122546be9f5d7c5f","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Heartbeat - 每日交易信号扫描\n\n## 🎯 心跳任务\n\n每次心跳时执行以下检查:\n\n### 1. 信息扫描\n- [ ] 扫描市场新闻 (加密货币/美股/宏观)\n- [ ] 检查财报日历 (今日/明日)\n- [ ] 获取恐惧贪婪指数\n\n### 2. 信号生成\n- [ ] 更新技术面指标\n- [ ] 检查预设品种的信号\n- [ ] 记录新信号到 signals/\n\n### 3. 模拟账户\n- [ ] 更新持仓价格\n- [ ] 计算当日 P&L\n- [ ] 检查止损/止盈是否触发\n\n### 4. 报告生成\n- [ ] 生成每日信号报告 (22:00)\n- [ ] 更新 performance.json\n\n---\n\n## 📅 扫描时间\n\n| 时间 | 任务 | 内容 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 08:00 | 早盘扫描 | 隔夜新闻,亚洲市场 |\n| 12:00 | 午盘扫描 | 午间更新,欧洲开盘 |\n| 18:00 | 晚盘扫描 | 美股盘中,财报更新 |\n| 22:00 | 夜盘扫描 | 收盘数据,每日报告 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔔 触发条件\n\n- 正常扫描: 每4小时\n- 重大事件: 新闻关键词触发\n- 止损触发: 模拟持仓触发止损\n\n---\n\n## 📤 输出\n\n- 信号文件: `signals/YYYY-MM-DD.json`\n- 报告文件: `reports/daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- 持仓更新: `paper-trading/portfolio.json`\n\n---\n\n*心跳配置版本: 1.0*\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776720557325}}
{"type":"message","id":"a91b2199","parentId":"e3cfbc0c","timestamp":"2026-04-20T21:29:50.683Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已读取 HEARTBEAT.md，当前时间接近 08:00 早盘扫描，开始执行信息扫描任务：市场新闻、恐惧贪婪指数和财报日历检查。\n\n\n收到！当前时间是 **2026-04-21 05:28 AM (Asia/Shanghai)**，接近 **08:00 早盘扫描** 时间。让我执行心跳任务：\n\n## 🔄 执行早盘扫描任务\n\n### 1️⃣ 信息扫描\n\n让我先扫描市场新闻和获取恐惧贪婪指数：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5cf5613d464d4bf0a85b4f3b","name":"coze_web_search","arguments":{"count":5,"needSummary":true,"query":"加密货币市场新闻 比特币 以太坊 2026 年 4 月","timeRange":"1d"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b9138927f709449ca9fc8969","name":"coze_web_search","arguments":{"count":3,"needSummary":true,"query":"crypto fear and greed index 2026"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fae7405af81f495bae666c12","name":"coze_web_search","arguments":{"count":3,"needSummary":true,"query":"earnings calendar April 2026 tech stocks"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"gitcode","model":"Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776720557328}}
{"type":"message","id":"44654479","parentId":"a91b2199","timestamp":"2026-04-20T21:29:51.156Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5cf5613d464d4bf0a85b4f3b","toolName":"coze_web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coze web search: 加密货币市场新闻 比特币 以太坊 2026 年 4 月\n\nResults (5)\n1. 《财经》客户端\n   URL: https://www.mycaijing.com/flash/detail/777627\n   Source: 《财经》客户端\n   Published: 2026-04-14T21:41:00+08:00\n   2026年04月14日 21:41\n【加密货币普遍大涨 比特币涨超5%升破7.5万美元】行情显示，比特币向上触及75000美元，过去24\n小时内涨5.42%。以太坊涨至2391.23美元，过去24小时内涨9.3%。\n\n2. 加密牛市势头:2026年比特币、Solana和以太坊的前景\n   URL: https://cj.sina.cn/articles/view/7879922977/1d5ae152101901ed9c\n   Source: 新浪财经\n   Published: 2026-04-13T08:25:33+08:00\n   加密牛市势头:2026年比特币、Solana和以太坊的前景\n看点资讯 2026-04-13 08:25:\n33\n加密货币市场正处于关键节点，迈入2026年第一季度。在未来几个月，行业分析师越来越多地指出，持续的\n加密牛市即将形成，动力可能在2026年中期加速。截止到2026年3月20日，比特币交易价格为70,046\n美元，索拉纳为88.99美元，以太坊为2,133.52美元——每个数字都反映了当前市场情绪，交易者正为潜\n3. [午夜行情简报]加密货币市场上涨…比特币75,090美元，以太坊2,357美元\n   URL: https://www.baiyi.com/news/591349.html\n   Source: 百亿财经\n   Published: 2026-04-14T23:03:39+08:00\n    23:03:39\n收藏\nBTC\nETH\n加密货币市场呈现整体上涨态势。根据Toke\nnPost Market数据，截至2026年4月15日凌晨0点04分（韩国标准时间）\n，比特币交易价格为75,090.18美元，较前一日上涨3.70%。以太坊交易价格为2\n,357.11美元，较前一日上涨5.50%。\n主要山寨币普遍上涨\n山寨币总市值为10\n,324亿6877万4332.65美元。24小时交易量达973亿8998万65.20\n4. 04/13 百亿财经加密社区晚报--加密市场低迷持续\n   URL: https://www.baiyi.com/market/589597.html\n   Source: 百亿财经\n   Published: 2026-04-13T17:12:55+08:00\n   17:12:55\n收藏\nBTC\nETH\n（2026年4月13日）过去24小时，加密货\n币市场延续低迷态势，整体情绪仍处于“Extreme Fear”区间（恐慌与贪婪指数约\n16）。比特币（BTC）在71,000美元附近震荡，先抑后小幅回稳，24小时小幅波动\n约-1%至+1%；以太坊（ETH）同步承压，价格徘徊在2,180-2,200美元一线\n，24小时小幅下跌约0.25%-1%。尽管地缘政治紧张与宏观不确定性持续施压风险资产\n5. 近18万人爆仓！比特币跳升5%重返 7.4 万美元， 以太坊飙升8%\n   URL: https://m.cn.investing.com/news/cryptocurrency-news/article-3309264\n   Source: 英为财情Investing.com\n   Published: 2026-04-14T11:00:00+08:00\n   近18万人爆仓！比特币跳升5%重返 7.4 万美元， 以太坊飙升8%\nPhyllis Li\n发布时间 2\n026-4-14 11:00\n© Reuters\nMSTR\n3.76%\nBitcoin US Dolla\n财情Investing.com -周二，4月14日，加密货币市场大幅回暖，比特币 (BitfinexUS\nD)强势跳升近5%，重回7.4万美元大关。\nETH/USD飙升8%，现报2371.93美元。\nCoing"}],"details":{"query":"加密货币市场新闻 比特币 以太坊 2026 年 4 月","type":"web","count":5,"items":[{"title":"《财经》客户端","url":"https://www.mycaijing.com/flash/detail/777627","siteName":"《财经》客户端","snippet":"2026年04月14日 21:41\n【加密货币普遍大涨 比特币涨超5%升破7.5万美元】行情显示，比特币向上触及75000美元，过去24\n小时内涨5.42%。以太坊涨至2391.23美元，过去24小时内涨9.3%。\n","content":"2026年04月14日 21:41\n【加密货币普遍大涨 比特币涨超5%升破7.5万美元】行情显示，比特币向上触及75000美元，过去24小时内涨5.42%。以太坊涨至2391.23美元，过去24小时内涨9.3%。\n","publishTime":"2026-04-14T21:41:00+08:00"},{"title":"加密牛市势头:2026年比特币、Solana和以太坊的前景","url":"https://cj.sina.cn/articles/view/7879922977/1d5ae152101901ed9c","siteName":"新浪财经","snippet":"加密牛市势头:2026年比特币、Solana和以太坊的前景\n看点资讯 2026-04-13 08:25:\n33\n加密货币市场正处于关键节点，迈入2026年第一季度。在未来几个月，行业分析师越来越多地指出，持续的\n加密牛市即将形成，动力可能在2026年中期加速。截止到2026年3月20日，比特币交易价格为70,046\n美元，索拉纳为88.99美元，以太坊为2,133.52美元——每个数字都反映了当前市场情绪，交易者正为潜","content":"加密牛市势头:2026年比特币、Solana和以太坊的前景\n看点资讯 2026-04-13 08:25:33\n加密货币市场正处于关键节点，迈入2026年第一季度。在未来几个月，行业分析师越来越多地指出，持续的加密牛市即将形成，动力可能在2026年中期加速。截止到2026年3月20日，比特币交易价格为70,046美元，索拉纳为88.99美元，以太坊为2,133.52美元——每个数字都反映了当前市场情绪，交易者正为潜在的收益布局。\n市场时机：为何2026年第一至第二季度可能成为转折点\n宏观策略师Raoul Pal及其他知名分析师预测，当前的市场结构支持2026年第二季度开始的重大反弹，高潮可能在6月左右到来。这一时间线与流动性状况的根本变化和 货币政策环境的演变相吻合。技术布局、宏观利好因素和改善的市场情绪共同营造出许多人认为的理想环境，为加密牛市的持续发展提供了有利条件。\n这一Q1-Q2窗口期的原因源于多重因素的汇聚。2026年初是机构资本部署的关键时期，主要法域的监管明确性持续改善。再加上货币政策的宽松，这些因素共同支撑了许多策略师对未来六个月看涨的信心。\n减半周期与历史模式支持牛市\n比特币2024年4月的减半事件为预测即将到来的加密牛市提供了重要的历史背景。市场周期通常显示，重大价格上涨大约在减半事件后12-18个月出现。这一历史规律直接指向2026年初至中期，作为加速上涨的潜在 黄金期，表明当前的宏观环境与比特币多年来的周期性行为模式相符。\n虽然历史先例不能保证未来，但它为理解为何许多分析师预期未来几个季度将持续走强提供了框架。减半周期依然是判断市场重大转折点最可靠的指标之一。\n可能推动市场上涨的催化剂\n2026年可能带来显著价格上涨的几个关键催化剂。中央银行进一步降息将减轻风险资产的阻力，而持续的监管突破可能释放机构资金流入。此外，关于实物资产代币化和AI 集成加密项目的新兴话题也是真正的催化剂，可能吸引新参与者并增强牛市动力。\n这些因素——从整体来看——形成了一个“势头带动势头”的局面。每一次监管明朗、机构参与或技术创新的积极进展，都可能成为下一轮上涨的触发点。然而，这些因素的实现仍取决于更广泛的宏观经济环境。\n山寨币与风险因素：并非所有币种同步上涨\n虽然比特币可能引领牛市，但山寨币如索拉纳和以太坊可能会因项目基本面、流动性状况和采用指标的不同而走出不同的路径。索拉纳当前价格为89.04美元，以太坊为2,133.52美元，反映出不同生态系统的细微差别。一些山寨币可能表现优异，而另一些则可能延迟上涨甚至进入盘整阶段，具体取决于市场状况和资金流动。\n这种差异强调了一个重要现实：并非所有加密资产都能同等受益于宏观利好。交易者和投资者必须对哪些资产符合整体牛市叙事保持选择性，因为偏差风险依然存在。市场周期会放大赢家，也会增加表现不佳资产的波动。\n结论\n2026年即将到来的加密牛市似乎拥有强劲的利好因素，2026年第一季度末至中期是最有可能实现持续上涨的窗口。历史减半周期、宏观环境改善、监管动向和新兴技术叙事共同支撑这一展望。然而，任何市场预测的实现都依赖于基本面实际的发展——在潜在的牛市逐步成型过程中，波动性可能仍将是其显著特征。\n","publishTime":"2026-04-13T08:25:33+08:00"},{"title":"[午夜行情简报]加密货币市场上涨…比特币75,090美元，以太坊2,357美元","url":"https://www.baiyi.com/news/591349.html","siteName":"百亿财经","snippet":" 23:03:39\n收藏\nBTC\nETH\n加密货币市场呈现整体上涨态势。根据Toke\nnPost Market数据，截至2026年4月15日凌晨0点04分（韩国标准时间）\n，比特币交易价格为75,090.18美元，较前一日上涨3.70%。以太坊交易价格为2\n,357.11美元，较前一日上涨5.50%。\n主要山寨币普遍上涨\n山寨币总市值为10\n,324亿6877万4332.65美元。24小时交易量达973亿8998万65.20","content":"[午夜行情简报]加密货币市场上涨…比特币75,090美元，以太坊2,357美元\n2026-04-14 23:03:39\n收藏\nBTC\nETH\n加密货币市场呈现整体上涨态势。根据TokenPost Market数据，截至2026年4月15日凌晨0点04分（韩国标准时间），比特币交易价格为75,090.18美元，较前一日上涨3.70%。以太坊交易价格为2,357.11美元，较前一日上涨5.50%。\n主要山寨币普遍上涨\n山寨币总市值为10,324亿6877万4332.65美元。24小时交易量达973亿8998万65.20美元。\n加密货币整体总市值录得25,363亿5423万3281.90美元。过去24小时加密货币总交易量为15,802亿4488万8765.49美元。\n比特币市场份额上升\n比特币市场份额为59.29%，较前一日增长0.25%。以太坊市场份额为11.23%，较前一日下降0.25%。比特币市场份额的上升表明市场资金正相对集中流向比特币。\n去中心化金融领域小幅上扬\n稳定币市场亦持续扩张。稳定币交易量激增显示市场闲置资金与短期交易需求正同步增长。\n加密衍生品市场表现活跃\n衍生品交易量骤增，可能预示着短期价格波动性将有所加剧。\n市场解读\n比特币与以太坊同步上涨，主要山寨币亦呈上升趋势，显示市场整体风险偏好有所改善。尤其是稳定币与衍生品交易量大幅增加，表明短期流动性与交易参与度正快速扩大。\n策略要点\n比特币市场份额上升，需关注市场可能延续以主流币种为核心的强势行情。但在衍生品交易激增的阶段，市场波动可能同步放大，采取分批布局策略相较追高买入更为稳妥。\n术语说明\n市场份额指特定加密货币市值占市场总值的比重。比特币市场份额上升通常意味着资金正更集中地流向比特币。\n","publishTime":"2026-04-14T23:03:39+08:00"},{"title":"04/13 百亿财经加密社区晚报--加密市场低迷持续","url":"https://www.baiyi.com/market/589597.html","siteName":"百亿财经","snippet":"17:12:55\n收藏\nBTC\nETH\n（2026年4月13日）过去24小时，加密货\n币市场延续低迷态势，整体情绪仍处于“Extreme Fear”区间（恐慌与贪婪指数约\n16）。比特币（BTC）在71,000美元附近震荡，先抑后小幅回稳，24小时小幅波动\n约-1%至+1%；以太坊（ETH）同步承压，价格徘徊在2,180-2,200美元一线\n，24小时小幅下跌约0.25%-1%。尽管地缘政治紧张与宏观不确定性持续施压风险资产","content":"04/13 百亿财经加密社区晚报--加密市场低迷持续\n2026-04-13 17:12:55\n收藏\nBTC\nETH\n（2026年4月13日）过去24小时，加密货币市场延续低迷态势，整体情绪仍处于“Extreme Fear”区间（恐慌与贪婪指数约16）。比特币（BTC）在71,000美元附近震荡，先抑后小幅回稳，24小时小幅波动约-1%至+1%；以太坊（ETH）同步承压，价格徘徊在2,180-2,200美元一线，24小时小幅下跌约0.25%-1%。尽管地缘政治紧张与宏观不确定性持续施压风险资产，但关键支撑位暂时守住，部分板块出现结构性亮点。Real World Assets（RWA）板块继续展现韧性， tokenized资产总值维持在27亿美元以上，机构配置兴趣未见明显减弱。\n行情与技术面：极端恐慌中支撑位考验持续\n比特币过去一天内测试71,000美元附近支撑，盘中一度面临卖压，但未出现大规模破位下行。市场参与者关注其能否守住50日均线等关键技术位，交易量较前期有所回落。ETH表现相对平稳，交易员聚焦2,000美元心理关口下方能否企稳。整体市场总市值维持在2.3-3.5万亿美元区间波动，24小时交易量温和变化。社区与互联网讨论中，地缘因素（如中东局势缓和信号或不确定性）被多次提及，作为影响风险资产短期走势的重要变量。矿工收入压力与长期持有者积累迹象并存，未见恐慌性抛售。\n机构与企业动态：RWA韧性凸显，支付与生态创新并行\n机构动向仍是焦点。尽管短期市场承压，tokenized Real World Assets总规模在4月持续增长，达到约27.6亿美元，部分子类目（如美国国债tokenization）录得流入。Ethereum继续主导RWA生态，BlackRock等机构的BUIDL等产品保持活跃。社区热议中，Decentralized AI与RWA被视为2026年主要叙事之一，机构资金偏好转向成熟基础设施。支付领域，加密在实体场景的应用讨论升温；同时，部分协议如Lido等流动性管理举措被提及，旨在增强持有人信心。散户与机构比特币持有量整体稳定，显示中长期配置意愿未完全消退。\n社区与互联网热点：恐慌情绪下的叙事转向\n过去24小时，加密社区与社交平台上，“Crypto Summer”相关讨论引发关注，部分观点认为当前极端恐慌或为周期底部信号，呼吁关注长期机构流入与比特币作为“数字黄金”的定位。DeFi TVL小幅调整，但RWA与AI-Blockchain交叉领域热度不减。预测市场与 meme 相关话题偶有活跃，反映零售情绪仍以观望为主。整体而言，市场在低波动中等待宏观催化剂，社区观点分化于短期风险与长期韧性之间。\n","publishTime":"2026-04-13T17:12:55+08:00"},{"title":"近18万人爆仓！比特币跳升5%重返 7.4 万美元， 以太坊飙升8%","url":"https://m.cn.investing.com/news/cryptocurrency-news/article-3309264","siteName":"英为财情Investing.com","snippet":"近18万人爆仓！比特币跳升5%重返 7.4 万美元， 以太坊飙升8%\nPhyllis Li\n发布时间 2\n026-4-14 11:00\n© Reuters\nMSTR\n3.76%\nBitcoin US Dolla\n财情Investing.com -周二，4月14日，加密货币市场大幅回暖，比特币 (BitfinexUS\nD)强势跳升近5%，重回7.4万美元大关。\nETH/USD飙升8%，现报2371.93美元。\nCoing","content":"近18万人爆仓！比特币跳升5%重返 7.4 万美元， 以太坊飙升8%\nPhyllis Li\n发布时间 2026-4-14 11:00\n© Reuters\nMSTR\n3.76%\nBitcoin US Dollar\n1.16%\nEthereum US Dollar\n0.50%\n英为财情Investing.com -周二，4月14日，加密货币市场大幅回暖，比特币 (BitfinexUSD)强势跳升近5%，重回7.4万美元大关。\nETH/USD飙升8%，现报2371.93美元。\nCoinglass数据显示，最近24小时加密货币市场近18万人爆仓，爆仓金额达5.32亿美元。\n消息面上，中东局势出现缓和信号，美伊停火谈判取得进展，市场风险偏好显著回升。与此同时，比特币大户Strategy向美国证券交易委员会提交的文件显示，该公司上周通过出售Stretch永久优先股，募集约10亿美元资金用于增持比特币。据悉，Strategy目前持有比特币总价值约550亿美元，稳居全球企业级比特币持有者首位。巨头持续加仓迭加地缘情绪修复，共同点燃了本轮加密市场反弹行情。\n","publishTime":"2026-04-14T11:00:00+08:00"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776720591153}}
{"type":"message","id":"3cd6f3ac","parentId":"44654479","timestamp":"2026-04-20T21:29:51.159Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b9138927f709449ca9fc8969","toolName":"coze_web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coze web search: crypto fear and greed index 2026\n\nResults (3)\n1. 原创 | 比特币跌破6.7万美元：恐惧贪婪指数跌至9，加密市场是否正在重演2022？\n   URL: http://m.163.com/dy/article/KQACC0RP051989UD.html\n   Source: 网易\n   Published: 2026-04-12T10:22:00+08:00\n   重演2022？\n南宫远\n2026-04-12 10:22\n市场概况：恐惧指数跌至冰点\n2026年4月第一周，加密货币市场经历了自2022\n年以来最剧烈的恐慌抛售。比特币价格一度跌破67,000美元关口，恐惧与贪婪指数（Fear & Greed Index）跌至仅9/100的\n极度恐惧区间。据Glassnode数据，2026年第一季度持有100至10,000枚BTC的巨鲸日均实现亏损达3.37亿美元，为2022 \n本文作者：南宫远\n2. Bitcoin Fear and Greed Hits 5-Week High Amid FUD Surge\n   URL: https://blockchain.news/flashnews/bitcoin-fear-and-greed-hits-5-week-high-amid-fud-surge\n   Source: Blockchain.News\n   Published: 2026-04-04T05:32:00+08:00\n   t chart reveals Bitcoin's fear vs. greed index at a \n5-week peak, signaling rising FUD in crypto markets \nas of April 4, 2026.\nAnalysis\nSantiment just dropped\n a bombshell chart showing Bitcoin's fear and greed \n3. Crypto Fear & Greed Index stands at 11, signaling continued extreme fear\n   URL: https://coinness.com/en/news/1153593\n   Source: 코인니스（CoinNess）\n   Published: 2026-04-04T08:05:00+08:00\n   11, though market sentiment remains in the extreme fear category. The index measures sentiment on a sc\nale of 0 for extreme fear to 100 for extreme optimism. It is calculated based on volatility (25%), tra"}],"details":{"query":"crypto fear and greed index 2026","type":"web","count":3,"items":[{"title":"原创 | 比特币跌破6.7万美元：恐惧贪婪指数跌至9，加密市场是否正在重演2022？","url":"http://m.163.com/dy/article/KQACC0RP051989UD.html","siteName":"网易","snippet":"重演2022？\n南宫远\n2026-04-12 10:22\n市场概况：恐惧指数跌至冰点\n2026年4月第一周，加密货币市场经历了自2022\n年以来最剧烈的恐慌抛售。比特币价格一度跌破67,000美元关口，恐惧与贪婪指数（Fear & Greed Index）跌至仅9/100的\n极度恐惧区间。据Glassnode数据，2026年第一季度持有100至10,000枚BTC的巨鲸日均实现亏损达3.37亿美元，为2022 \n本文作者：南宫远","content":" \n本文作者：南宫远","publishTime":"2026-04-12T10:22:00+08:00"},{"title":"Bitcoin Fear and Greed Hits 5-Week High Amid FUD Surge","url":"https://blockchain.news/flashnews/bitcoin-fear-and-greed-hits-5-week-high-amid-fud-surge","siteName":"Blockchain.News","snippet":"t chart reveals Bitcoin's fear vs. greed index at a \n5-week peak, signaling rising FUD in crypto markets \nas of April 4, 2026.\nAnalysis\nSantiment just dropped\n a bombshell chart showing Bitcoin's fear and greed ","content":"4/4/2026 5:32:00 AM\nBitcoin Fear and Greed Hits 5-Week High Amid FUD Surge\nSantiment's latest chart reveals Bitcoin's fear vs. greed index at a 5-week peak, signaling rising FUD in crypto markets as of April 4, 2026.\nAnalysis\nSantiment just dropped a bombshell chart showing Bitcoin's fear and greed index spiking to a five-week high, driven by a wave of FUD that's rattling traders worldwide. This surge comes as crypto markets grapple with regulatory pressures from the SEC's latest crackdown on decentralized exchanges, echoing the turmoil seen in late 2025 when similar oversight fears tanked altcoin values by double digits.\nDigital Currencies\nMarket Sentiment Shifts Signal Volatility Ahead\nTraders track these metrics obsessively. Santiment's data highlights how greed overtakes fear during bull runs, but the current FUD—fueled by geopolitical tensions in Europe—mirrors the sentiment dip in October 2025, when Bitcoin briefly dipped below key support levels. Investors now eye this index for clues on potential rebounds, blending on-chain analytics with broader crypto market trends to navigate the noise.\nBroader assets feel the ripple too. Ethereum and other tokens show similar greed spikes, tying into the AI-driven DeFi boom from early 2026 that promised yields but delivered regulatory headaches. Analysts warn that unchecked FUD could suppress adoption, yet strategic players position for a sentiment flip, leveraging tools like Santiment for an edge in this high-stakes game.\nDigital Currencies\n4/4/2026, 6:01:00 AM\nDogecoin Nears Breakout as Triangle Apex Looms\nDogecoin squeezes toward a critical triangle apex on daily charts, heightening breakout odds and signaling potential trend shift in volatile crypto markets.\nAnalysis\nDogecoin traders hold their breath as the meme coin compresses tightly toward the apex of a symmetrical triangle on its daily chart, a formation that screams impending volatility. Analyst Trader Tardigrade, known for sharp crypto insights, flags this squeeze as a powder keg ready to ignite, with the next price move poised to dictate the asset's short-term trajectory. This setup echoes patterns seen in Dogecoin's wild swings over the past six months, where similar consolidations preceded sharp rallies amid broader market euphoria driven by Elon Musk's sporadic endorsements and meme coin fervor.\nRSI Holds Back Clear Signals Amid Tension\nThe latest daily candle closure amplifies the tension, trapping Dogecoin in a vice grip that sets the stage for either a explosive breakout or a disheartening breakdown. RSI indicators remain stubbornly neutral, refusing to tip the scales and leaving traders scanning for fresh clues. In the context of recent history, Dogecoin navigated regulatory scrutiny on meme assets last fall, bouncing back with community-driven pumps that integrated blockchain upgrades, underscoring its resilience in a maturing crypto landscape.\nMarket watchers like Tardigrade promise real-time updates as hints emerge, a nod to the high-stakes game where strategic positioning in Dogecoin could yield outsized returns. This moment captures the essence of crypto's macro-technical dance, blending technical formations with sentiment-driven narratives that have propelled Dogecoin from joke status to a serious contender in digital finance over the last year.\nTrader Tardigrade\n","publishTime":"2026-04-04T05:32:00+08:00"},{"title":"Crypto Fear & Greed Index stands at 11, signaling continued extreme fear","url":"https://coinness.com/en/news/1153593","siteName":"코인니스（CoinNess）","snippet":"11, though market sentiment remains in the extreme fear category. The index measures sentiment on a sc\nale of 0 for extreme fear to 100 for extreme optimism. It is calculated based on volatility (25%), tra","content":"Crypto Fear & Greed Index stands at 11, signaling continued extreme fear\nApril 04, 2026, 8:05 AM\nThe Crypto Fear & Greed Index from data provider Alternative has risen two points from yesterday to 11, though market sentiment remains in the extreme fear category. The index measures sentiment on a scale of 0 for extreme fear to 100 for extreme optimism. It is calculated based on volatility (25%), trading volume (25%), social media mentions (15%), surveys (15%), Bitcoin's market cap dominance (10%), and Google search volume (10%).\n","publishTime":"2026-04-04T08:05:00+08:00"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776720591156}}
{"type":"message","id":"5866cdb4","parentId":"3cd6f3ac","timestamp":"2026-04-20T21:29:51.174Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fae7405af81f495bae666c12","toolName":"coze_web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coze web search: earnings calendar April 2026 tech stocks\n\nResults (3)\n1. 2026年4月当前技术股全景趋势(A股+美股，截至4.14)一、美股科技(纳指、_财富号_东方财富网\n   URL: https://caifuhao.eastmoney.com/news/20260415083957626772850\n   Source: 财富号\n   Published: 2026-04-15T08:39:00+08:00\n   仪态万千的闻笛4  2026年04月15日 08:39  浙江$众泰汽车(SZ000980)$2026年4月 当前技术股全景趋势（A股+美股，截至4.14）一、美股科技（纳指、半导体）：AI硬件强势走\n2. AI &     Quantum Opportunities After Tech Sell-Off: 2 Stocks for April\n   URL: https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/ai-quantum-opportunities-after-tech-sell-2-stocks-april\n   Source: Nasdaq\n   Published: 2026-03-31T14:00:00+08:00\n   Stocks\nAI & Quantum Opportunities After Tech Sell-Off: 2 Stocks for April\nMarch 31, 2026 — 02:00 pm \n3. 科技股逆势上扬：英伟达领跑，迈威尔涨6.9%引关注\n   URL: https://m.sohu.com/a/1008000417_121924584/\n   Source: 手机搜狐网\n   Published: 2026-04-11T04:00:00+08:00\n   科技股逆势上扬：英伟达领跑，迈威尔涨6.9%引关注AI创新实验室2026-04-11 04:00美股市场在最新交易日中延续震荡格局，其中科技板块表现亮眼，成为全市场的焦点。标普500指数初步收跌0.1 \n本文作者：AI创新实验室"}],"details":{"query":"earnings calendar April 2026 tech stocks","type":"web","count":3,"items":[{"title":"2026年4月当前技术股全景趋势(A股+美股，截至4.14)一、美股科技(纳指、_财富号_东方财富网","url":"https://caifuhao.eastmoney.com/news/20260415083957626772850","siteName":"财富号","snippet":"仪态万千的闻笛4  2026年04月15日 08:39  浙江$众泰汽车(SZ000980)$2026年4月 当前技术股全景趋势（A股+美股，截至4.14）一、美股科技（纳指、半导体）：AI硬件强势走","content":"仪态万千的闻笛4  2026年04月15日 08:39  浙江\n$众泰汽车(SZ000980)$\n2026年4月 当前技术股全景趋势（A股+美股，截至4.14）\n一、美股科技（纳指、半导体）：AI硬件强势走牛\n• 盘面：纳指连续走强、再创历史新高；费城半导体指数爆发新高，科技七巨头领涨大盘\n• 最强主线：AI算力芯片+存储芯片\n云厂商资本开支暴增（谷歌/微软/亚马逊全年合计近5700亿美金），算力芯片、服务器极度紧缺\n存储全球涨价周期：DRAM二季度预计涨40%+、NAND涨70%+，美光、西部数据、闪迪全线新高\n• 龙头表现：英伟达、博通、台积电、英特尔、超微电脑全线走强；英特尔单周暴涨23%\n• 风险：美联储降息节奏、AI商业化兑现、高位估值拥挤\n二、A股科技/TMT：放量反弹、算力半导体领全市场\n• 盘面：4月上旬大幅反弹，4.14放量大涨；电子+科创50+TMT全线走强，沪指站稳4000点，北向大幅净流入\n• 最强细分（资金扎堆）\n1. 存储芯片：全球涨价+AI需求，江波龙、佰维存储批量涨停，板块领涨全市场\n2. 光模块/CPO/光通信：1.6T高景气，中际旭创等千亿市值新高\n3. PCB、先进封测、算力服务器：产业链量价齐升、业绩兑现\n4. AI办公/应用：一季报高增带动情绪\n• 产业逻辑：AI算力硬件国产替代+上游材料/晶圆/存储涨价周期延续Q2\n• 结构分化：硬科技强、软件应用分化；只炒龙头、小票补涨弱\n三、共同大逻辑（全球一致）\n1. AI基础设施长周期：海外云厂资本开支爆发，算力硬件供需紧张至少持续2026全年\n2. 半导体周期反转：存储、面板、功率器件全面涨价，行业底确立\n3. 政策+国产替代：信创、芯片自主可控，国内硬科技持续溢价\n4. 一季报窗口期：业绩超预期品种继续走强，兑现差直接杀估值\n四、短期走势判断（1-2个月）\n• 整体：震荡上行、结构性牛市，普涨难、龙头行情\n• 顺序：算力芯片→存储→光模块→封测设备→AI应用\n• 节奏：业绩驱动为主，高位震荡洗盘，不会单边疯涨\n• 最大变量：美联储利率、一季报业绩、地缘冲突\n五、风险提示\n信息仅供参考，不构成投资建议\n• 高位龙头估值偏高，波动放大\n• AI商业化落地不及预期\n• 海外制裁、供应链扰动\n• 一季报业绩不及预期杀估值\n","publishTime":"2026-04-15T08:39:00+08:00"},{"title":"AI &     Quantum Opportunities After Tech Sell-Off: 2 Stocks for April","url":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/ai-quantum-opportunities-after-tech-sell-2-stocks-april","siteName":"Nasdaq","snippet":"Stocks\nAI & Quantum Opportunities After Tech Sell-Off: 2 Stocks for April\nMarch 31, 2026 — 02:00 pm ","content":"Stocks\nAI & Quantum Opportunities After Tech Sell-Off: 2 Stocks for April\nMarch 31, 2026 — 02:00 pm EDT\nWritten by Urmimala Biswas for Zacks ->\nGlobal technology stocks will enter April 2026 under significant pressure, not from weak fundamentals but from macroeconomic and geopolitical shocks. The most important catalyst has been the 2026 Iran war, which triggered a surge in oil prices, inflation fears and global market volatility, leading to a broad sell-off in technology and semiconductor stocks. The conflict has disrupted energy markets and supply chains, particularly due to the risks to the Strait of Hormuz, a critical chokepoint for oil and industrial supply routes, affecting semiconductor production and technology infrastructure worldwide.\nDespite these near-term pressures, artificial intelligence and quantum computing remain among the most important long-term structural technology trends. This article discusses two technology stocks to buy in April 2026, NVIDIA NVDA  and International Business Machines IBM, which provide exposure to artificial intelligence and quantum computing, respectively.\nEnergy Costs, AI Infrastructure and Market Valuations\nThe impact is especially pronounced in artificial intelligence, where large-scale models rely on highly energy-intensive infrastructure. Reuters, citing S&P Global estimates, notes that rising power costs could pressure returns on the hundreds of billions being deployed into the AI ecosystem. At the same time, the broader technology sell-off may prove more persistent than prior cyclical pullbacks. As highlighted by Axios, rising oil prices, interest-rate uncertainty and heavy AI capital spending are creating structural pressure on Big Tech valuations.\nQuantum Computing and Risk-Off Sentiment\nQuantum computing companies, even though currently in the early commercialization cycle, are also affected by tighter funding conditions and risk-off sentiment, as investors shift away from long-duration, high-capex technology themes during periods of geopolitical and macroeconomic uncertainty.\nLong-Term Structural Growth Remains Intact\nThe long-term case for artificial intelligence and quantum computing remains strong. Large technology companies are still increasing their capital spending on AI infrastructure, highlighting how important AI has become for businesses, governments and national competitiveness. At the same time, quantum computing is increasingly seen as a strategic technology, especially for cryptography, defense and advanced computing, which is likely to support continued government and private sector funding.\nFrom an investment perspective, the current market environment looks more like a valuation reset rather than a breakdown in the long-term growth story. Many market researchers believe that the recent sell-off is creating selective buying opportunities in high-growth technology sectors. In this environment, AI and quantum stocks still offer strong long-term upside potential, supported by structural demand, government support and increasing real-world applications, even though short-term performance may remain influenced by geopolitical events and macroeconomic uncertainty.\nNVDA-IBM YTD Stock Performances\nImage Source: Zacks Investment Research\n2 AI and Quantum Stocks to Buy in April 2026\nNVIDIA : It remains the dominant supplier of GPUs used to train large AI models, making it the core infrastructure provider of the AI economy. Demand for its data-center chips continues to surge and AI workloads remain heavily dependent on NVIDIA hardware and software ecosystems. Despite a stock correction in 2026 affected by geopolitical risks and concerns about AI spending returns, NVIDIA still maintains strong margins and earnings expectations and we view the valuation reset as a buying opportunity.\nNVIDIA currently sports a Zacks Rank #1 (Strong Buy). Despite the year-to-date 11.4% dip in share price, the short-term price targets offered by 47 analysts represent an increase of 63.2% from the last closing price of $165.17. In fiscal 2027 (ending Jan 2027), NVDA is expected to report earnings growth of 66.9% on revenue growth of 63.1%.\nImage Source: Zacks Investment Research\nIBM : It has already generated more than $1 billion in cumulative quantum-related revenues, indicating early commercialization progress compared to most quantum peers, which remain largely pre-profit. Its strength lies in a full-stack ecosystem including quantum hardware, Qiskit software and enterprise partnerships.\nIBM allows investors to gain exposure to quantum computing through a diversified and profitable business model rather than relying on a pure-play quantum company. This is particularly relevant at the moment, as higher interest rates, geopolitical uncertainty and risk-off market sentiment have made investors more cautious toward early-stage, high-cash-burn, speculative quantum pure-plays.\nIBM currently holds a Zacks Rank #2 (Buy). Despite the year-to-date 19.9% dip in share price, the short-term price targets offered by 21 analysts represent an increase of 32.3% from the last closing price of $237.25. In 2026, IBM is expected to report earnings growth of 6.7% on revenue growth of 5.5%.\nImage Source: Zacks Investment Research\nZacks' Research Chief Names \"Stock Most Likely to Double\"\nOur team of experts has just released the 5 stocks with the greatest probability of gaining +100% or more in the coming months. Of those 5, Director of Research Sheraz Mian highlights the one stock set to climb highest.\nThis top pick is a little-known satellite-based communications firm. Space is projected to become a trillion dollar industry, and this company's customer base is growing fast. Analysts have forecasted a major revenue breakout in 2025. Of course, all our elite picks aren't winners but this one could far surpass earlier Zacks' Stocks Set to Double like Hims & Hers Health, which shot up +209%.\nInternational Business Machines Corporation (IBM) : Free Stock Analysis Report\nThis article originally published on Zacks Investment Research (zacks.com).\nZacks Investment Research\nTags\nStocks\n","publishTime":"2026-03-31T14:00:00+08:00"},{"title":"科技股逆势上扬：英伟达领跑，迈威尔涨6.9%引关注","url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/1008000417_121924584/","siteName":"手机搜狐网","snippet":"科技股逆势上扬：英伟达领跑，迈威尔涨6.9%引关注AI创新实验室2026-04-11 04:00美股市场在最新交易日中延续震荡格局，其中科技板块表现亮眼，成为全市场的焦点。标普500指数初步收跌0.1 \n本文作者：AI创新实验室","content":"科技股逆势上扬：英伟达领跑，迈威尔涨6.9%引关注\nAI创新实验室\n2026-04-11 04:00\n美股市场在最新交易日中延续震荡格局，其中科技板块表现亮眼，成为全市场的焦点。标普500指数初步收跌0.1%，日用消费品板块和能源板块分别下挫1.6%和0.9%，而科技板块逆势上涨0.7%。与此同时，科技权重更高的纳斯达克100指数初步收涨0.1%，多只核心科技股表现强劲，尤其是迈威尔科技 （Marvell Technology），涨幅高达6.9%，成为当天市场的明星个股。\nAI与芯片驱动科技股强势反弹\n迈威尔科技的出色表现反映了市场对AI芯片需求持续增长的预期。作为一家专注于数据中心、人工智能和5G网络芯片的供应商，迈威尔近几个季度持续受益于企业对高性能计算解决方案的需求。英伟达（NVIDIA）、AMD、博通等芯片巨头同样表现不俗，涨幅均超过2%。其中，英伟达的股价上涨约2.3%，继续巩固其在AI计算领域的领导地位。\n值得关注的是，ASML（阿斯麦）ADR作为光刻机设备领域的龙头企业，也录得约2%的涨幅。ASML的设备是生产高端芯片的关键工具，其股价表现一定程度上反映了芯片产业链的整体健康度。与此同时，AppLovin等面向应用开发和广告技术领域的公司股价也表现强劲，显示出科技板块在不同赛道上的多点开花。\n网络安全板块承压，个股分化明显\n然而，并非所有科技公司都能在当日实现增长。网络安全领域的多只个股显著下挫，其中Zscaler股价下跌3.7%，CrowdStrike和派拓网络（Palo Alto Networks）分别下跌4.2%和6.7%。这些公司的疲软表现可能与投资者对其估值水平的重新审视以及宏观经济环境的不确定性有关。\n此外，铿腾电子（Synaptics）股价重挫5.5%，Salesforce下跌3.6%，进一步显示出科技板块内部的分化加剧。与此形成对比的是，亚马逊上涨1.9%，成为当日纳斯达克100指数的另一亮点。\n市场波动中的长期观察\n从市场整体来看，科技板块的强势反弹不仅受益于AI和芯片赛道的持续热度，也反映了投资者对技术创新推动增长的长期信心。然而，网络安全领域的短期波动表明，高估值科技公司的压力仍未完全释放。随着全球经济环境的变化以及行业竞争的加剧，科技企业的盈利能力和估值水平将持续受到考验。\n展望未来，AI芯片和高性能计算无疑是推动科技板块继续向前的核心动力。投资者需要密切关注企业的财报表现以及行业动态，以更好地把握潜在机遇。\n你认为未来哪个科技领域将成为资本市场的下一个风口？欢迎在评论区分享你的观点。\n \n本文作者：AI创新实验室","publishTime":"2026-04-11T04:00:00+08:00"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776720591172}}
